<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="desktop-pet-display" content="desktop-overlay"><script type="application/json" id="pet-sdk">{"version":2,"permissions":["character:read","sessions:connect"],"network":["lan"],"interaction":{"players":2,"transport":"lan","protocol":{"id":"pet-hide-duel","version":2}}}</script><title>躲好了吗？ · 局域网对决</title><style>__STYLE__</style></head>
<body><main id="app">
<header class="masthead"><div><span class="eyebrow">PAPER PLAYGROUND · 02</span><h1>躲好了吗<span>？</span></h1></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="pill"><i></i> 局域网双人对决</span><details class="audio-settings"><summary>声音</summary><div><label>音效<input id="audio-sfx" aria-label="音效音量" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="40"></label><label>背景音乐<input id="audio-music" aria-label="背景音乐音量" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0"></label><small id="audio-status">拖到最左侧静音 · 设置自动保存</small></div></details><button id="help-toggle" class="quiet" aria-expanded="false">玩法说明</button></div></header>
<aside id="help" hidden><strong>轮流躲藏，找出纸墙后的朋友。</strong><p>每人 100 血。射手每轮有 3 发，命中扣 34 血并立即换边；3 发用完或 20 秒结束也会换边。准备时间 3 秒。一枪可以同时打碎砖块和命中墙后的宠物。</p><p>开局前选定 2D 姿势，或正面拖动 3D 玩偶的手脚、肘膝并确认。入局后四肢和尺寸固定，只能用 A / D、左右方向键或按钮左右移动，并在屏幕平面内旋转；旋转冷却 1 秒。墙的破损会保留。整局最多 6 分钟，时间到时血量多的一方获胜，同血量平局。</p><p>从桌宠发送游戏并接受邀请后，双方会自动绑定连接。发送方的游戏页面须保持打开。独立服务模式仍可手动填写相同地址和房间码。短暂断线会暂停，30 秒内可恢复；主动离开算认输。</p></aside>
<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<section id="lobby" class="lobby">
 <article class="pet-card"><div class="card-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR LITTLE COMPANION</span><span class="tag" id="pet-source">当前桌宠</span></div><h2>今天，让它来躲。</h2><div class="pet-display"><span class="paper-note">摆好姿势<br>再来藏。</span><canvas id="pet-preview" width="300" height="240" aria-label="当前宠物和实际姿势预览"></canvas><div class="floor-line"></div></div><div class="pet-caption"><strong id="pet-name">正在读取你的桌宠…</strong><span id="pet-status">会自动带入当前形象</span></div><section id="pose-editor" class="pose-editor" hidden aria-label="3D 玩偶初始姿势编辑"><div class="card-heading"><strong>先摆一个藏身姿势</strong><span class="tag">正面锁定</span></div><p class="muted small">拖动手脚、肘和膝。身体始终正对屏幕，四肢不会向前后扭转。</p><canvas id="pose-editor-canvas" width="480" height="560" tabindex="0" aria-label="正面玩偶：拖动手脚与肘膝来摆姿势"></canvas><div class="pose-editor-actions"><button id="reset-pose" class="secondary">恢复站姿</button><button id="confirm-pose" class="primary">确认初始姿势</button></div><p id="pose-status" class="muted small" role="status">摆好后确认。入局后四肢固定，只能左右移动和平面旋转。</p></section><div id="lobby-poses" class="pose-row"></div><p id="pet-metrics" class="muted small"></p><div class="scale-control"><label for="pet-scale">初始大小 <strong id="scale-value">85%</strong></label><input id="pet-scale" type="range" min="0" max="25" value="10" step="1" disabled><p id="scale-status" class="muted small">检查轮廓有效面积后开放可用比例</p><canvas id="scale-preview" width="1253" height="213" aria-label="完整墙面与当前宠物的实际比例"></canvas><p class="muted small">实战比例预览 · 宠物显示在墙前便于比较</p></div><details class="custom"><summary>使用自己的图片</summary><p>也可以添加 1–3 张透明 PNG / WebP。多姿势使用相同画布尺寸，共用缩放比例。</p><input id="upload" type="file" accept="image/png,image/webp" multiple aria-label="添加自定义宠物姿势"><button id="use-current" class="quiet">恢复当前桌宠</button><p id="upload-status" role="status"></p></details></article>
 <div class="lobby-right"><div class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HIDE & SEEK</span><h2>一面纸墙。<br>三个机会。</h2><p>让你的桌宠躲起来，<br>和同一网络里的朋友来一场小小对决。</p></div><section class="connect-card"><label for="player-name">你的对局名字</label><input id="player-name" maxlength="12" placeholder="给朋友一个熟悉的名字" autocomplete="off"><label for="server-address">房主的服务地址</label><div class="server-line"><input id="server-address" placeholder="http://192.168.1.8:18765" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off"><button id="connect" class="secondary">连接</button></div><p id="connection-status" class="connection">等待连接本地服务</p><div class="room-actions"><button id="create" class="primary" disabled>创建房间 <span>↗</span></button><span class="or">或</span><div class="join-line"><input id="room-code" maxlength="6" placeholder="6 位房间码" aria-label="房间码" autocomplete="off"><button id="join" class="secondary" disabled>加入好友</button></div></div><details class="setup-help"><summary>第一次联机？</summary><p>房主双击「启动局域网.command」（Windows 用 .cmd），保持服务窗口打开。把显示的局域网地址发给朋友。两人连接同一个 Wi-Fi，填写相同地址后建房、加入。</p><p>若连接失败，请检查地址、端口和系统防火墙是否允许局域网访问。</p></details></section></div>
</section>
<section id="room" hidden><div class="room-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR SMALL PLAYGROUND</span><h2>房间 <span id="room-number"></span></h2></div><button id="leave" class="quiet">离开房间</button></div>
 <div id="waiting" class="waiting"><div><h2 id="waiting-title">等朋友来，一起藏。</h2><p id="waiting-status">把邀请信息发给同一网络里的朋友。</p><label for="invite">邀请信息</label><div class="invite-line"><input id="invite" readonly><button id="copy-invite" class="secondary">复制</button></div></div><div class="ready-card"><span class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span><strong id="room-players"></strong><p>初始姿势和大小已锁定。双方准备后开始。</p><button id="ready" class="primary">我准备好了</button></div></div>
 <div id="arena" hidden><div class="scoreboard"><div class="player"><span class="player-mark">你</span><div><strong id="self-name"></strong><span class="hp-label"><b id="self-hp">100</b> / 100</span><div class="health"><b id="self-health"></b></div></div></div><div class="round"><span id="turn-number">第 1 回合</span><strong id="role-title">准备藏好</strong><span id="countdown"></span></div><div class="player opponent"><div><strong id="opponent-name"></strong><span class="hp-label"><b id="opponent-hp">100</b> / 100</span><div class="health"><b id="opponent-health"></b></div></div><span class="player-mark">友</span></div></div>
 <p id="role-cue" class="role-cue" role="status" hidden></p><div class="stage"><div id="combat-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden><strong></strong><span></span></div><canvas id="board" width="1400" height="450" tabindex="0" aria-label="对局场地。躲藏时使用 A、D 或左右方向键移动，射击时方向键瞄准，空格射击。"></canvas><div id="stage-banner" hidden><strong></strong><span></span></div></div>
 <div class="game-controls"><div><span class="eyebrow" id="control-label">换个姿势躲起来</span><div id="game-poses" class="pose-row"></div></div><div id="move-controls" aria-label="躲藏移动方向"><button class="secondary" data-direction="ArrowLeft" aria-label="向左移动">←</button><button class="secondary" data-direction="ArrowRight" aria-label="向右移动">→</button></div><div id="rotate-controls"><button id="rotate-left" class="secondary" aria-label="逆时针旋转 15 度">↶ 15°</button><span id="angle-value">0°</span><button id="rotate-right" class="secondary" aria-label="顺时针旋转 15 度">15° ↷</button></div><div id="shoot-controls"><div id="ammo" aria-label="剩余子弹"></div><button id="fire" class="primary">发射 <small>空格</small></button></div><p id="game-hint"></p></div>
 <details id="precision"><summary>瞄准微调</summary><div class="sliders"><label>左右<input id="aim-x" type="range" min="0" max="1252" step="1" value="626" aria-label="横向瞄准"></label><label>上下<input id="aim-y" type="range" min="0" max="212" step="1" value="106" aria-label="纵向瞄准"></label></div></details>
 <p id="shot-feedback" class="shot-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">每一个小洞，都是线索。</p></div>
 <section id="result" hidden><span class="eyebrow">THAT WAS A GOOD ROUND</span><strong id="result-badge" class="result-badge"></strong><h2 id="result-title"></h2><p id="result-detail"></p><div class="result-actions"><button id="rematch" class="primary">再来一局</button><button id="back-lobby" class="secondary">回到大厅</button></div><p id="rematch-status" class="muted"></p></section>
</section><footer><span>2D 角色与 3D 玩偶 · 纸板对决</span><span id="footer-state">你的形象，你的藏法。</span></footer>
<dialog id="leave-dialog"><h2>现在离开这局？</h2><p>进行中的对局会判为认输。</p><div class="result-actions"><button id="cancel-leave" class="secondary">继续玩</button><button id="confirm-leave" class="primary">离开</button></div></dialog>
</main><script>__SCRIPTS__</script></body></html>
